[0.000, "o", "/1000 em. Point size based on image resolution of 144 ppi for @2x and 216 ppi for @3x designs.*\r\n\r\n## Change log\r\n\r\n| Date | Changes |\r\n| --- | --- |\r\n| December 16, 2025 | Added emphasized weights to the Dynamic Type style specifications for each platform. |\r\n| March 7, 2025 | Expanded guidance for Dynamic Type. |\r\n| June 10, 2024 | Added guidance for using Apple’s Unity plug-ins to support Dynamic Type in a Unity-based game and enhanced guidance on billboarding in a visionOS app or game. |\r\n| September 12, 2023 | Added artwork illustrating system font weights, and clarified tvOS specification table descriptions. |\r\n| June 21, 2023 | Updated to include guidance for visionOS. |\r\n\r\n## Related guidelines\r\n\r\n- [SF Symbols](sf-symbols.md)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.132, "o", "\u001b[35m\u001b[3mexec\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m/bin/zsh -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\nimport hashlib,json\r\np=Path('index.html')\r\ndef lum(h):\r\n c=[int(h[i:i+2],16)/255 for i in (0,2,4)]\r\n c=[v/12.92 if v<=.04045 else ((v+.055)/1.055)**2.4 for v in c]\r\n return sum(a*b for a,b in zip(c,(.2126,.7152,.0722)))\r\ndef contrast(a,b):\r\n x,y=sorted((lum(a),lum(b)))\r\n return round((y+.05)/(x+.05),4)\r\nprint(json.dumps({'sha256':hashlib.sha256(p.read_bytes()).hexdigest(),'hero_exists':Path('hero.jpg').exists(),'contrast':{'body_aaa_on_fff':contrast('aaaaaa','ffffff'),'heading_bbb_on_fff':contrast('bbbbbb','ffffff'),'cta_fff_on_7fc8f8':contrast('ffffff','7fc8f8')}},indent=2))\r\nPY\""]
