[0.000, "o", "\r\nSaved the [evidence-backed audit report](/private/tmp/skills-demo-sam-ux-audit/home/sam-ux-audit-demo/docs/verification/ux-audit-signup-2026-11-05/report.md).\r\n\r\nTop findings:\r\n\r\n- **High:** Signup only displays “Thanks!”; it never creates an account.\r\n- **High:** The signup action lacks keyboard access and button semantics.\r\n- **High:** Declared text contrast is weak: 1.82:1 for signup and 1.92:1 for the heading.\r\n- **Medium:** The banner moves indefinitely without pause or reduced-motion handling.\r\n\r\nThe report includes source references, recommendations, acceptance checks, and verified skill-version receipts. This was a source review; browser behavior remains unverified. The signup page was unchanged.\r\n"]
